 532:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   11) Sets other CSD configurations (Csd Auto Zero time,
 533:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *       Sample Init period, interrupts,
 534:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *       CMOD and Csh_tank/shield initialization switch resistance).
