1327:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** ****************************************************************************//**
1328:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1329:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** * \brief
1330:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   Starts the CSD conversion.
1331:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1332:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** * \details
1333:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   This function assumes that the CSD block is already set up using
1334:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   the CapSense_CSDSetupWidget API and the sensor port-pin is connected to the CSD
1335:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   block using CapSense_CSDConnectSns.
1336:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   For CSDv1 the function performs the following tasks:
1337:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   1. Disconnects the Vref buffer from AMUX;
1338:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   2. Precharges Cmod;
1339:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *   3. Makes the PreSettling delay to have a stable Vref voltage;
