1415:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1416:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** * \brief
1417:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  Starts the CSD conversion on the preconfigured sensor.
1418:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_CSDSetupWidgetExt() function should be used to setup the
1419:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  widget when using this function.
1420:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1421:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** * \details
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lenovo\AppData\Local\Temp\ccWkzfML.s 			page 27


1422:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  This function performs single scanning of one sensor in the widget configured
1423:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  by the CapSense_CSDSetupWidgetExt() function. It does the following
1424:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  tasks:
1425:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *    1. Sets the busy flag in the CapSense_dsRam structure.
1426:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *    2. Performs the clock-phase alignment of the sense and modulator clocks.
1427:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *    3. Performs Cmod pre-charging.
1428:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *    4. Starts single scanning.
1429:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1430:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  It is not recommended to call this function directly from the application
1431:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  layer. This function should be used to implement only the user’s specific
1432:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  use cases (for faster execution time or pipeline scanning for example).
1433:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  This function should be called when no scanning in progress. I.e.
1434:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_IsBusy() returns a non-busy status.
1435:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1436:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  The sensor must be preconfigured by using the
1437:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_CSDSetupWidgetExt() API prior to calling this function.
1438:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  The sensor remains ready for the next scan if a previous scan was triggered
1439:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  by using the CapSense_CSDScanExt() function. In this case, calling
1440:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_CSDSetupWidgetExt() is not required every time before the
1441:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_CSDScanExt() function. If a previous scan was triggered in
1442:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  any other way: CapSense_Scan(), CapSense_ScanAllWidgets() or
1443:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_RunTuner() (see the CapSense_RunTuner() function
1444:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  description for more details), the sensor must be preconfigured again by
1445:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  using the CapSense_CSDSetupWidgetExt() API prior to calling the
1446:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_CSDScanExt() function.
1447:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1448:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  If disconnection of the sensors is required after calling
1449:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  CapSense_CSDScanExt(), the CapSense_CSDDisconnectSns()
1450:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  function can be used.
1451:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
1452:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *******************************************************************************/
1453:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** void CapSense_CSDScanExt(void)
1454:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** {
