1942:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
1943:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     * \brief
1944:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  Computes the Modulator IDAC value for one sensor that provides raw signal at
1945:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  the specified level.
1946:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
1947:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     * \details
1948:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   The function performs the following tasks:
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lenovo\AppData\Local\Temp\ccWkzfML.s 			page 43


1949:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   1. Initialises The Compensation IDAC to zero
1950:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   2. Enables the calibrated sensor
1951:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   3. Performs eight iteration steps to get the target = rawLevel
1952:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *      setting and resetting the IDAC value bits beginning from the
1953:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *      MSB bit to an MSB bit.
1954:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   4. Disables the calibrated sensor
1955:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   5. Checks if the IDAC is in the correct range
1956:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   6. Updates the maximum IDAC value in the widget
1957:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   7. Stores the temporary ModIDAC8 value (in the single-IDAC mode).
1958:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
1959:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  The CSD block should be initialized with the CapSense_SsCSDInitialize()
1960:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  API before using this function.
1961:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
1962:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     * \param  rawLevel
1963:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *   The raw data level which should be reached during the calibration procedure.
1964:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     * \param  ptrIdac  The pointer to IDAC.
1965:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     * \param  iDAC8Max The pointer to the maximum IDAC value in the widget.
1966:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
1967:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     * \return Returns the status of operation:
1968:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  - Zero     - All the sensors in the widget are calibrated successfully.
1969:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  - Non-Zero - Calibration failed for any sensor in the widget.
1970:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
1971:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *******************************************************************************/
1972:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     static cystatus CapSense_SsCSDCalibrateOneSensor(uint32 rawLevel,
