2138:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     * \details
2139:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  Performs a successive approximation search algorithm to find appropriate
2140:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  IDAC values for sensors in the specified widget that provides the raw
2141:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  count to the level specified by the target parameter.
2142:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
