2144:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  IDAC mode (Enable compensation IDAC is enabled) is configured, the IDAC
2145:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  values are re-calculated to match the raw count target. If a widget
2146:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  consists of two or more elements (buttons, slider segments, etc.), then
2147:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  calibration is performed by the element with the highest sensor
2148:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  capacitance.
2149:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *
2150:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  Calibration fails if the achieved raw count is outside of the +/-10%
2151:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c ****     *  range of the target.
