2468:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  This function initializes the Cmod charging to Vref.
2469:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
2470:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** * \details
2471:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  For CSDv1:
2472:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  The function initializes the Cmod charging to Vref.
2473:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  Then it waits the even when Cmod is completely charged
2474:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  to Vref to have stable Rawcounts. Software Watchdog Counter is implemented to
2475:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  prevent the project hanging.
2476:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
2477:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  For CSDv2:
2478:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  Coarse initialization for CMOD and Cch.
2479:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  The coarse initialization is performed by HSCOMP.
2480:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  The HSCOMP monitors the Cmod voltage via Cmod sense path
2481:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  and charges the Cmod using HCAV switch via CSDBUS-A, AMUXBUS-A
2482:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  and static connection of Cmod to AMUXBUS-A.
2483:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
2484:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *******************************************************************************/
