2605:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
2606:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** * \brief
2607:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  This function triggers the scanning.
2608:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
2609:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** * \details
2610:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  For CSDv1:
2611:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  Writes resolution to start the scanning.
2612:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
2613:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  For CSDv2:
2614:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  Trigger the fine initialization (scan some dummy cycles) and start sampling.
2615:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  Fine initialization for CMOD and Start scan.
2616:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  For the fine initialization and sampling, Cmod is static connected to AMUXBUS-A
2617:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  and in every conversion (one cycle of SnsClk), the sensor capacitance is charged
2618:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  from Cmod and discharged to ground using the switches in GPIO cell.
2619:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  The CSDCOMP monitors voltage on Cmod using the sense path and charges Cmod back
2620:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *  to Vref using IDACs by connecting IDAC to CSDBUS-A and then the AMUXBUS-A.
2621:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *
2622:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_SensingCSD_LL.c **** *******************************************************************************/
